<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">北京 2025 基线版</text>
    <view class="hero-title">先选中高中，再用校排名看孩子大概在北京什么位置。</view>
    <view class="hero-lead">
      这不是填一堆表，而是先把学校选准，再补齐年级人数和排名口径，才开始估算市级区间。
    </view>
    <view class="hero-note">当前结果为预测参考，不替代官方位次。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-block">
    <view class="section-title">校排入口</view>
    <view class="section-subtitle">
      家长通常只记得学校和校排。这个入口会强制补上最低必要信息，避免把结果算偏。
    </view>

    <view class="field-list">
      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">所在区<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{districtOptions}}" value="{{districtIndex}}" bindchange="handleDistrictChange">
          <view class="field-picker {{districtLabel ? '' : 'placeholder'}}">
            {{districtLabel || '先选所在区，能明显降低学校混淆'}}
          </view>
        </picker>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">搜索高中<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <view class="search-box">
          <input
            class="field-input"
            placeholder="例如：人大附、北交附中、汇文中学"
            value="{{schoolQuery}}"
            bindinput="handleSchoolQueryInput"
            confirm-type="search"
          />

          <view wx:if="{{searchResults.length > 0}}" class="search-results">
            <view
              wx:for="{{searchResults}}"
              wx:key="school_id"
              class="search-item"
              data-item="{{item}}"
              bindtap="handleSchoolSelect"
            >
              <view class="search-item-top">
                <text class="search-item-name">{{item.short_name}}</text>
                <text class="search-item-score">{{item.matchReasonLabel}}</text>
              </view>
              <view class="search-item-meta">
                {{item.official_name}}｜{{item.district}}｜{{item.entityTypeLabel}}
              </view>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view wx:if="{{selectedSchool.school_id}}" class="selected-school">
          <view class="selected-school-title">{{selectedSchool.short_name}}</view>
          <view class="selected-school-meta">
            {{selectedSchool.official_name}}｜{{selectedSchool.district}}｜{{selectedSchool.entityTypeLabel}}
          </view>
          <view class="field-tip">已选中这所学校，可以继续填写排名。如果不是这所，请重新搜索或点候选结果切换。</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">校排名<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <input
          class="field-input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="请输入年级排名，例如 120"
          value="{{gradeRank}}"
          bindinput="handleGradeRankInput"
        />
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">年级总人数<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <input
          class="field-input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="请输入年级总人数，例如 680"
          value="{{gradeTotal}}"
          bindinput="handleGradeTotalInput"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">如果缺这个值，系统只能给非常粗的区间，不建议直接估算。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">排名口径<text class="required">*</text></text>
        <view class="segmented">
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'same_track' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="same_track" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            同类选科
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'full_grade' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="full_grade" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            全年级
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{rankingBasis === 'unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="unknown" bindtap="handleRankingBasisSelect">
            不确定
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="field">
        <text class="field-label">一模/二模分数（可选）</text>
        <view class="segmented score-source">
          <view class="segment {{examType === 'first_mock' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="first_mock" bindtap="handleExamTypeSelect">
            一模
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{examType === 'second_mock' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="second_mock" bindtap="handleExamTypeSelect">
            二模
          </view>
          <view class="segment {{examType === 'mock_unknown' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="mock_unknown" bindtap="handleExamTypeSelect">
            不确定
          </view>
        </view>
        <input
          class="field-input"
          type="number"
          placeholder="如果知道一模/二模分数，区间会更收窄"
          value="{{score}}"
          bindinput="handleScoreInput"
        />
        <view class="field-tip">不是必填。没有分数也可以先用校排名估算；有分数时会叠加 2025 位次参考。</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="cta-area">
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="handleEstimate">估算北京市位次区间</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="info-panel">
    <view class="info-title">为什么要补“年级总人数”和“排名口径”？</view>
    <view class="info-copy">
      同样写“第 400 名”，如果是全年级大排名和同类选科排名，含义完全不同。年级人数也会直接改变你在校内所处百分位。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{estimateResult}}" class="result-block">
    <view class="result-title">当前原型结果</view>
    <view class="result-row">
      <text class="result-key">命中学校</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{estimateResult.selectedSchool}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="result-row">
      <text class="result-key">实体类型</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{estimateResult.entityType}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="result-row">
      <text class="result-key">估算区间</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{estimateResult.rankRange}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="result-row">
      <text class="result-key">置信度</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{estimateResult.confidence}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="result-row">
      <text class="result-key">说明</text>
      <text class="result-value">{{estimateResult.explanation}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

